---
import UtilityPage from '../layouts/UtilityPage.astro';
import { NTPC_SOURCES } from '../data/examGuidance';
---
<UtilityPage title="RRB NTPC Document Upload Guide 2026: 30–70 KB Signature, Live Photo & PDF Rules" description="Complete RRB NTPC document upload rules (CEN 06 & 07): 30–70 KB signature resizer, webcam live photo instructions & SC/ST travel certificate PDF checklist.">
  <section class="rounded-2xl border-2 border-primary/30 bg-primary/10 p-4 sm:p-5 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4">
    <div class="space-y-1">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary">
        <span>⚡</span>
        <span>Official CEN Tool</span>
      </div>
      <h3 class="font-bold text-foreground text-sm sm:text-base">Resize RRB NTPC Signature to 30–70 KB (140×60 px)</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">Format running black-ink signature to exact CEN 05 & 06/2024 / 2026 rrbapply.gov.in portal specifications.</p>
    </div>
    <a href="/rrb-ntpc-signature-resize/" class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-primary text-primary-foreground font-bold text-xs hover:opacity-90 transition shrink-0 flex items-center gap-1.5 shadow-sm">
      <span>Launch NTPC Resizer (30-70 KB)</span>
      <span>&rarr;</span>
    </a>
  </section>
  <section class="rounded-2xl border border-primary/20 bg-primary/5 p-5 space-y-3">
    <p class="text-xs font-bold text-primary tracking-wider">SOURCE: CEN 07/2025 UNDERGRADUATE FAQ · REVIEWED 28 OCTOBER 2026</p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">Check the CEN for your application</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">This checklist uses the verified 2025 Undergraduate FAQ. It does not confirm application dates, vacancies or upload rules for CEN 07/2026. Graduate recruitment has a separate notice. Read your active CEN and any corrections before submitting.</p>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-xs font-semibold">
      <a class="text-primary underline" href={`${NTPC_SOURCES.undergraduate}#page=12`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Official UG FAQ: documents, Q59–60</a>
      <a class="text-primary underline" href={`${NTPC_SOURCES.undergraduate}#page=15`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Official UG FAQ: live photo and signature, Q73–74</a>
      <a class="text-primary underline" href="https://www.rrbapply.gov.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">RRB application portal</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
    <article class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 space-y-3">
      <h2 class="font-bold">Signature upload</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Prepare your own running signature in black ink on white paper as a 30–49 KB JPG/JPEG. The FAQ specifies minimum 140 × 60 pixels, a scan of at least 100 DPI and a 35 × 20 mm box. Keep all strokes clear.</p>
      <a class="text-primary text-sm font-semibold" href="/rrb-ntpc-signature-resize/">Prepare NTPC signature →</a>
    </article>
    <article class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 space-y-3">
      <h2 class="font-bold">Live photograph</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Complete live capture inside the RRB application using the permitted camera method. A pre-existing photograph or resized image cannot replace this step.</p>
      <a class="text-primary text-sm font-semibold" href="/live-webcam-photo-checker/">Practise camera framing only →</a>
    </article>
    <article class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 space-y-3">
      <h2 class="font-bold">SC/ST certificate for free travel</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">This upload applies to eligible applicants requesting the free travel facility. The FAQ calls for PDF: Q60 says up to 400 KB, while Q32 says below 400 KB. Keep the PDF below 400 KB and confirm the active field. A JPG from an image resizer is not the required PDF.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 space-y-3">
      <h2 class="font-bold">Education and other records</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Keep your original education and applicable category records ready. Follow your CEN for format, validity and verification-stage requirements; do not assume every record needs an image upload during the initial application.</p>
    </article>
  </section>
  <section class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 space-y-3">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">Before submitting</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Reopen each file and inspect its clarity, complete content, actual format and byte size. Check the application preview. Renaming an extension does not convert a file, and compression cannot restore missing detail. These tools cannot certify portal acceptance.</p>
  </section>
</UtilityPage>
